        {"zh": "我举着两只钳子等你。", "en": "I hold both claws up and wait for you."},
        {"zh": "我的目标是鳕鱼！", "en": "My target is cod!"},
        {"zh": "锁定目标，开动！", "en": "Target locked, let’s go!"},
        {"zh": "我要吃你这块肉！", "en": "I’m going to eat this flesh!"},
        {"zh": "鳕鱼，我要吃了你！", "en": "Cod, I’m going to eat you!"},
        {"zh": "我来了，别想跑！", "en": "Here I come, no running!"},
        {"zh": "我的爪子来了！", "en": "My claws are coming!"},
        {"zh": "鳕鱼，我的下一个目标！", "en": "Cod, my next target!"},
        {"zh": "我是螃蟹，你是我的！", "en": "I’m a crab, and you’re mine!"}
      ]
    },
